"""Physics 101 — গল্পে গল্পে পদার্থবিজ্ঞান (Oishi). Twenty chapters for a complete beginner, taught like class five and getting
gradually harder (no formula before chapter 7). Data only: site_physics.py turns it into slides.

Per chapter: story (8 lines) · terms (6) · concept · try-at-home activity · medical link (positive only) · quiz (6).
Content rule: whenever a doctor is mentioned write "হোমিওপ্যাথিক ডাক্তার" (never bare "ডাক্তার").
"""
